<%
/*
 * Eta template for ONE per-entity child page family — every projected entity
 * type's child pages render through this single template
 * ([[D-0010-deterministic-site-assembly]] §4, §6; generalized from the D-0009
 * glossary/references child pages).
 *
 * Fed by renderChildPage in site/projections_render.ts via
 * renderSiteTemplate("site_child_page_template", data).
 * Data shape (it.*):
 *   title       string   frontmatter title (already escapeFmString'd)
 *   description string   frontmatter description (already escapeFmString'd)
 *   sourceRel   string   source path relative to project root
 *   metaLine    string   joined meta line e.g. "**Status:** `open/active` · **Aliases:** west wind"
 *                        (empty string when no meta items)
 *   body        string   body content (wikilinks resolved, block-ids stripped, trimmed;
 *                        a projection's child-body appendix — e.g. references'
 *                        "## Cited by" — is already concatenated in)
 *   backLabel   string   e.g. "Back to the Glossary"
 *   backRoute   string   e.g. "/glossary/"
 *
 * TypeScript owns data derivation; this template owns ALL layout. Column /
 * meta variations live in projection data, not template forks.
 *
 * The file ends with "[← label](route)\n" — single trailing newline.
 */
%>---
title: "<%~ it.title %>"
description: "<%~ it.description %>"
---

<!-- AUTO-GENERATED by `sdlc docs generate site` (solutions/ontological/lib/services/docs/site.ts) from <%~ it.sourceRel %>. Do not edit by hand. -->

<%~ it.metaLine ? it.metaLine + "\n\n" : "" %><%~ it.body %>

---

[← <%~ it.backLabel %>](<%~ it.backRoute %>)
